<title>USA: Apollo Biopharma suspends trading.</title>
<headline>Apollo Biopharma suspends trading.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apollo BioPharmaceutics Inc said Wednesday it had suspended trading of its common stock and common stock purchase warrants, and that it would not effect a closing of its initial public offering today due to certain unresolved issues with its underwriters.</p>
</text>
